@startuml activity-update-payment-status
' Update payment status: the payment gateway sends the result of an online
' payment (webhook). Pay online (activity 9) may already have updated the
' payment; then the event changes nothing.

title Update payment status

|Payment gateway|
|Coffee Shop System|
|Email service|

|Payment gateway|
start
:Send the payment result\n(succeeded or failed);
|Coffee Shop System|
:Check the event signature;
if (Valid?) then ([no])
  :Reject the event;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Find the order's payment;
if (Already up to date?) then ([yes])
  :Ignore the event;
  stop
else ([no])
endif
if (Result?) then ([succeeded])
  :Mark the payment PAID\n(and the order Confirmed);
  |Email service|
  :Send the order confirmation;
else ([failed])
  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Mark the payment FAILED\n(keep the reason);
endif
stop

@enduml
